          "title": "*",
          "content": "<p><em>一句话消息</em>*</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://nintendosmash.com/over-three-billion-people-worldwide-now-play-video-games-study-reports/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">研究报告</a>称，目前全球有31亿人玩视频游戏，其中有一半只在手机上玩。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202008/bg2020082302.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2020/08/29/us/japan-flying-car.html/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">日本公司 SkyDrive</a> 称，它已经制造完成了“飞行汽车”，世界第一台垂直起降的电动飞行器，试飞了四分钟。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202008/bg2020083001.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2020/08/31/amazon-prime-now-drone-delivery-fleet-gets-faa-approval.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">亚马逊</a>获得美国政府批准，可以使用无人机送货。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202009/bg2020090102.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://siberiantimes.com/other/others/news/giant-new-50-metre-deep-crater-opens-up-in-arctic-tundra/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">北极</a>新出现了一个深达50米的巨型“火山口”，据信这是由于地下甲烷爆炸导致的。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202008/bg2020083004.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202008/bg2020083005.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>- <a href=\"https://www.zdnet.com/article/mozilla-research-browsing-histories-are-unique-enough-to-reliably-identify-users/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mozilla 的员工</a>发现，只要根据某个人的50条～150条的浏览历史，就足以识别一个人。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202009/bg2020090203.jpg\"