    {
      "id": "言论",
      "title": "言论",
      "items": [
        {
          "title": "架",
          "content": "<p>构师的工作不是做出决策，而是尽可能久地推迟决策，先在不做出重大决策的情况下构建程序，以便以后有足够信息时再做出决策。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://tomgamon.com/posts/2020-08-25-dont-marry-your-design/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Bob Martin</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Bob Martin",
              "url": "https://tomgamon.com/posts/2020-08-25-dont-marry-your-design/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "公",
          "content": "<p>钥加密已经发明40多年了，但是我们仍然把魔术数字印在信用卡上，任何看到它们的人都可以未经授权拿走我们所有的钱。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24277899\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hacker News 读者</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Hacker News 读者",
              "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24277899"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "我",
          "content": "<p>曾经极度贫穷，冬天开不起暖气。我发现，最好的取暖方法是晚上在毛毯下塞一只猫，放在两腿之间，并且将毯子拉到头顶上方，留出缝隙以呼吸。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24277128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hacker News 读者</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Hacker News 读者",
              "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24277128"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "我",
          "content": "<p>加入谷歌，是因为需要更多钱；离开谷歌，是因为需要更多时间。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://theartofmachinery.com/2020/08/04/leaving_google.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《离开谷歌的这五年》</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "《离开谷歌的这五年》",
              "url": "https://theartofmachinery.com/2020/08/04/leaving_google.html"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "压",
          "content": "<p>力分成好几种。有一些压力让你感觉快要死了，另一些压力让你感觉自己更有生命力。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://theartofmachinery.com/2020/08/04/leaving_google.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《离开谷歌的这五年》</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "《离开谷歌的这五年》",
              "url": "https://theartofmachinery.com/2020/08/04/leaving_google.html"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "如",
          "content": "<p>果微软推出容器服务，有些人是不会买的。但是，GitHub 的容器服务，他们就会买。我认为，这就是微软收购 GitHub 的部分原因。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24346163\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hacker News 读者</a>评论 <a href=\"https://github.blog/2020-09-01-introducing-github-container-registry/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub 推出容器仓库服务</a></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "Hacker News 读者",
              "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=24346163"
            },
            {
              "text": "GitHub 推出容器仓库服务",
              "url": "https://github.blog/2020-09-01-introducing-github-container-registry/"
            }
          ]
        }
